<title>USA: Amcore to announce transaction.</title>
<headline>Amcore to announce transaction.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amcore Financial Inc, a Rockford, Illinois-based bank holding company said it plans to make an announcement on Thursday afternoon regarding a transaction with another publicly traded company.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the $2.76 billion asset bank holding company said the transaction would allow Amcore to expand its geographic area, but would not say which business line it would involve. He declined futher comment.  </p>
<p>Amcore has banking, trust, insurance underwriting, mortgage, consumer finance and collection businesses.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3/8 at 21-1/8 on Nasdaq Thursday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
